<Positioned left="200" top="742"><Row crossAxisAlignment="END"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="16" color="#2563EB" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="1.5">观察记录 / WHAT TO LOOK AT</Text><SizedBox width="14"/><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="18" color="#64748B">说明写在实验区外；所有区域 320×240 白底</Text></Row></Positioned>
<Positioned left="200" top="770"><Container width="330" height="140" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="14"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN">
<Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#0B1220" fontStyle="BOLD">① alpha 叠加</Text></Row>
<SizedBox height="4"/>
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#475569">红/蓝各自 50% alpha，按红→蓝→白底顺序合成；重叠处理论为 (127,63,191)。</Text>
</Column></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="555" top="770"><Container width="330" height="140" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="14"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN">
<Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#0B1220" fontStyle="BOLD">② 组不透明度</Text></Row>
<SizedBox height="4"/>
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#475569">不透明红蓝先在 Opacity 0.5 组内合成，再整体叠白底；样本理论为 (128,128,255)。</Text>
</Column></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="910" top="770"><Container width="330" height="140" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="14"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN">
<Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#0B1220" fontStyle="BOLD">③ 仅背景模糊</Text></Row>
<SizedBox height="4"/>
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#475569">BackdropFilter 只作用卡内背景；条纹跨卡边，卡外仍锐利，SHARP / BLUR 清晰。</Text>
</Column></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="200" top="924"><Container width="330" height="140" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="14"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN">
<Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#0B1220" fontStyle="BOLD">④ 子树模糊</Text></Row>
<SizedBox height="4"/>
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#475569">同一场景整卡子树 ImageFiltered；文字与形状一起变糊，卡外条纹仍清晰。</Text>
</Column></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="555" top="924"><Container width="330" height="140" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="14"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN">
<Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#0B1220" fontStyle="BOLD">⑤ 滤色 + 模糊</Text></Row>
<SizedBox height="4"/>
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#475569">MULTIPLY 后 sigma 6；透明间隙、深色矩形、阴影一起被处理，可观察边缘扩散。</Text>
</Column></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="910" top="924"><Container width="330" height="140" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #E1E7F0" padding="14"><Column crossAxisAlignment="START" mainAxisSize="MIN">
<Row crossAxisAlignment="CENTER"><Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#0B1220" fontStyle="BOLD">⑥ 同⑤ + 圆裁</Text></Row>
<SizedBox height="4"/>
<Text fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontSize="20" color="#475569">在最外层加 ClipOval，圆心 (160,120)、r100；圆周切过黄色形状，边界可见。</Text>
</Column></Container></Positioned>
</Stack></Container></Snapshot>